# ── CORS Proxy for TMDB API (production override) ──
# The committed .env routes every request through a free CORS proxy, which is
# slow and rate-limited for a public site. TMDB's API supports CORS natively,
# so the deployed site calls api.themoviedb.org directly.
#
# If api.themoviedb.org is blocked in your visitors' region, restore the proxy:
#   VITE_CORS_PROXY=https://corsproxy.io/?
VITE_CORS_PROXY=
